# FANUC R-30iB Industrial Robot Spot Welding Project

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates an automotive spot-welding application using a FANUC industrial robot with an R-30iB controller and servo welding gun.

## Software and Equipment
- **Simulation Software:** FANUC ROBOGUIDE
- **Robot Controller:** FANUC R-30iB
- **Welding Gun:** Servo Spot-Welding Gun
- **Application:** Automotive Sheet-Metal Spot Welding

## Project Features
- Two sample spot-welding locations
- Robot approach and retract movements
- Illustrative FANUC LS program
- ROBOGUIDE setup instructions
- Project documentation and safety considerations

## Project Files
- `FANUC_R30iB_Servo_Gun_Spot_Welding_Report.docx` – Project report
- `FANUC_R30iB_Spot_Weld.LS` – Illustrative robot program
- `FANUC_ROBOGUIDE_Spot_Welding_Setup_Guide.txt` – Setup instructions

## Important Note
This is an educational simulation project. Robot positions and welding parameters must be verified and configured by qualified personnel before any physical operation.

